---
import ChartScale from './ChartScale.astro';
---
<section id="overview-view" class="view">
  <header class="page-heading overview-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / FINANCIAL OVERVIEW</p><h1>Your money, in view.</h1><p class="subtitle">See where it goes. Make room for what comes next.</p></div><div class="overview-controls"><label class="period-control">Period<select id="period"><option value="3">Last 3 complete months</option><option value="1">Last complete month</option><option value="6">Last 6 complete months</option><option value="12">Last 12 complete months</option><option value="current">This month so far</option><option value="all">All history</option><option value="custom">Custom dates</option></select></label><label class="grouping-control">Grouping<select id="overview-grouping" aria-describedby="overview-grouping-note"><option value="day">Daily</option><option value="week" selected>Weekly</option><option value="month">Monthly</option></select></label><ChartScale id="overview-scale" /><p id="overview-grouping-note" class="input-note">Grouping is chosen automatically when the period changes.</p></div></header>
  <div id="custom-range" class="custom-range" hidden><label>From<input id="range-start" type="date"></label><label>Through<input id="range-end" type="date"></label></div>
  <div class="period-caption" id="period-caption"></div>
  <div id="metrics" class="metrics"></div>
  <p id="comparison-caption" class="statistics-caption"></p>
  <div class="overview-grid">
    <article class="card cashflow-card"><div class="card-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE BIG PICTURE</p><h2>Money in, money out</h2></div><span id="cashflow-grouping" class="badge">Weekly</span></div><div id="cashflow-chart" class="chart"></div><p class="chart-note">Out includes spending and transfers to savings outside the export. Transfers between named accounts are excluded.</p></article>
    <article class="outlook-card"><span class="pill">LOOKING AHEAD</span><h2 id="outlook-title"></h2><p id="outlook-copy"></p><div class="outlook-rule"></div><p class="outlook-small" id="outlook-basis"></p><button class="light-button" data-view="forecast">Explore your forecast <span>↗</span></button></article>
  </div>
  <div class="detail-grid history-grid">
    <article class="card" aria-labelledby="spending-trend-title"><div class="card-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">FIND YOUR RHYTHM</p><h2 id="spending-trend-title">Spending over time</h2></div><span id="spending-grouping" class="badge">Weekly</span></div><div id="spending-trend-chart"></div><p id="spending-trend-note" class="chart-note"></p></article>
    <article class="card" aria-labelledby="cash-change-title"><div class="card-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE DIRECTION OF TRAVEL</p><h2 id="cash-change-title">Cash change over time</h2></div><span class="badge">From zero</span></div><div id="cash-change-chart"></div><p class="chart-note">Cumulative incoming money minus spending and external savings in the selected period. This is a change in cash, not your account balance. Internal transfers are excluded.</p></article>
  </div>
  <article class="card statistics-card" aria-labelledby="period-insights-title"><div class="card-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">BEHIND THE TOTALS</p><h2 id="period-insights-title">Your period in perspective</h2></div></div><dl id="period-insights" class="statistics-grid"></dl><p id="period-insights-note" class="input-note"></p></article>
  <div class="detail-grid">
    <article class="card"><div class="card-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">WHERE IT GOES</p><h2>Spending by category</h2></div><span class="muted small">Click to explore</span></div><div id="categories"></div></article>
    <article class="card"><div class="card-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE EVERYDAY DETAILS</p><h2>Top places & payments</h2></div></div><div id="merchants"></div></article>
  </div>
  <article class="review-banner" id="review-banner"><div><strong id="review-title"></strong><p>Some transfers and uncategorized payments need a closer look. You can correct them and mark one-off payments.</p></div><button id="review-button" class="outline-button">Review transactions →</button></article>
</section>
